  ('5d950e76-6ea2-56a7-8a0d-fd8dd012d87c', '7d8a4645-364c-5d6f-90cc-1bebc2ffd0f7', 'Army', 'enlisted', '11Z', null, 'development', 'E-8', null, 'Master sergeant (MSG)/first sergeant (1SG) — recommended career management (applies to every MOS in this career management field)', 'Chapter 3. Recommended career management self-development, by rank', '(1) In addition to those publications and reading lists mentioned in the ranks above, MSGs/1SGs should also study and master the following military publications: AR 601–280, AR 600–20, DA Pam 611–21, AR 840–10, and AR 220–1.
