  ('9d67d176-a51f-501d-b0f3-025ca54b7ca6', '7d8a4645-364c-5d6f-90cc-1bebc2ffd0f7', 'Army', 'enlisted', '11Z', null, 'development', 'E-9', null, 'Sergeant major (SGM)/command sergeant major (CSM) — recommended career management (applies to every MOS in this career management field)', 'Chapter 3. Recommended career management self-development, by rank', '(1) SGMs/CSMs should read publications on the professional reading lists of their chains of command and senior leaders.
